# Project structure (must)

Next.js App Router landing pack. Keep this tree. Do not invent parallel folders.

## Repo tree

```text
src/
  app/                    # Routes only (thin)
    layout.tsx            # Root shell, fonts, metadata, JsonLd
    page.tsx              # Home: compose sections only
    not-found.tsx         # Branded 404
    robots.ts
    sitemap.ts
    icon.png / apple-icon.png
  components/
    home/                 # Home landing sections
    <landing>/            # Other routes: one folder per landing
    layout/               # Header, Footer
    brand/                # Logo, BrandIcon
    forms/                # react-hook-form
    ui/                   # Button, ScrollToTop, primitives
    seo/                  # JsonLd
  config/
    brand.ts              # Asset paths + brand tokens
    site.ts               # URL, nav, contact, keywords
  data/
    home.ts               # Home copy
    error.ts              # 404 copy
    <landing>.ts          # Per-landing copy
  lib/
    seo.ts                # buildMetadata, JSON-LD helpers
public/
  <asset-pack>/           # Local images / SECTION-GUIDE
  favicon.png / icon.png / apple-icon.png
  videos/                 # Optional
.cursor/rules/            # Agent rules (.mdc)
```
## Where code goes

| Kind | Path | Example |
|------|------|---------|
| Route page | `src/app/<route>/page.tsx` | Compose only |
| Home section | `src/components/home/<Name>.tsx` | `Hero`, `About` |
| Other landing section | `src/components/<slug>/<Name>.tsx` | |
| Header / Footer | `src/components/layout/` | |
| Logo / marks | `src/components/brand/` | |
| Forms | `src/components/forms/` | |
| Shared UI | `src/components/ui/` | `ButtonLink`, `ScrollToTop` |
| SEO widgets | `src/components/seo/` | `JsonLd` |
| Copy | `src/data/*.ts` | No secrets, no em/en dashes |
| Tokens / paths | `src/config/brand.ts`, `site.ts` | |
| Helpers | `src/lib/` | |
| Media | `public/<pack>/` | Via `@/config/brand` |

Imports: `@/components/...`, `@/config/...`, `@/data/...`, `@/lib/...`.

## Component base (must)

1. **Thin page** - `page.tsx` imports sections; no section markup dump
2. **One section = one file** - e.g. `home/Hero.tsx` exports `Hero`
3. **Named exports** matching file purpose
4. **`"use client"`** only for nav, motion, Swiper, forms, measured UI, portals
5. **Server by default** - static sections stay server components when possible
6. **Shared before duplicate** - extract to `ui/*` / `brand/*` / `forms/*`
7. **Copy out of JSX** - strings in `src/data/*`
8. **Paths/colors out of JSX** - `src/config/*` + CSS vars in `globals.css`
9. **Below-fold** - `next/dynamic` from page when needed
10. **New landing** - `app/<slug>/page.tsx` + `components/<slug>/` + `data/<slug>.ts`

### Thin page pattern

```tsx
// src/app/page.tsx - compose only
import { Header } from "@/components/layout/Header";
import { Hero } from "@/components/home/Hero";
// dynamic(...) for below-fold sections
export default function Home() {
  return (
    <main className="min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-x-clip">
      <Header />
      <Hero />
      {/* sections... */}
    </main>
  );
}
```

