Add sections under `home/` as the design lands. Also see `src/STRUCTURE.md`.

## Never

- Dump sections into `page.tsx` / `layout.tsx`
- New top-level `src/sections` or `src/views` (use `components/<landing>/`)
- Hardcode asset pack paths in components (use `brand.ts`)
- Mix Footer CTA anatomy into a mid-page section (`footer-anatomy.mdc`)
- Clone Home folders onto another landing unless design matches (`per-landing-ui.mdc`)

